# P13 batch 1
#. event 00 (look)
msgctxt "bark 0432:00B0"
msgid "dead guardsman "
msgstr "死去的衛兵"

# P13 batch 1
#. event 00 (look)
msgctxt "bark 0432:00D3"
msgid "guardsman "
msgstr "衛兵"

# P13 batch 1
#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 0432:01C6"
msgid "Guardsman! "
msgstr "衛兵！"

# P13 batch 1
#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 0432:028B"
msgid "You must find safety, stranger, for the Titans spew their hatred upon us! "
msgstr "你得找個安全的地方，陌生人，泰坦們正把他們的怒火傾瀉在我們身上！"

# P13 batch 1
#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 0432:0366"
msgid "Quickly seek shelter from the death that walks and the ground that quakes, stranger, lest you find death yourself. The once-buried now roam freely and must be stopped! "
msgstr "快找地方躲避行走的死亡和震動的大地，陌生人，免得你自己也送了命。那些曾經被埋葬的死者如今四處遊蕩，一定要阻止他們！"

# P13 batch 1
#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 0432:03D0"
msgid "Always hassling me! What do you want this time? "
msgstr "老是來找我麻煩！這次你又想幹嘛？"

# P13 batch 1
#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 0432:0423"
msgid "Is there something I can do for you? "
msgstr "有什麼我能為你效勞的嗎？"

# P13 batch 1
#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 0432:0457"
msgid "Always with the questions! "
msgstr "老是在問問題！"

# P13 batch 1
#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 0432:048C"
msgid "What do you want, stranger? "
msgstr "你想幹嘛，陌生人？"

# P13 batch 1
#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "ask 0432"
msgid "Bye "
msgstr "再見"

# P13 batch 1
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Who are you? "
#. answer compared by the conversation code
msgctxt "ask 0432"
msgid "Who are you? "
msgstr "你是誰？"

# P13 batch 1
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Who are you? "
msgctxt "bark 0432:055F"
msgid "I am called Pellgun. "
msgstr "我叫佩爾岡。"

# P13 batch 1
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "What is your duty? "
#. answer compared by the conversation code
msgctxt "ask 0432"
msgid "What is your duty? "
msgstr "你的職責是什麼？"

# P13 batch 1
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "What is your duty? "
msgctxt "bark 0432:05EF"
msgid "I am charged with protecting the Tempest, Devon. "
msgstr "我負責保護風暴使者戴文。"

# P13 batch 1
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "What is your duty? "
msgctxt "bark 0432:0636"
msgid "I am charged with protecting the Lady Mordea. "
msgstr "我負責保護莫爾迪亞夫人。"

# P13 batch 1
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Where am I? "
#. answer compared by the conversation code
msgctxt "ask 0432"
msgid "Where am I? "
msgstr "這是哪裡？"

# P13 batch 1
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Where am I? "
msgctxt "bark 0432:06BA"
msgid "You are in the royal palace of the Tempest, Devon. "
msgstr "你在風暴使者戴文的王宮裡。"

# P13 batch 1
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Where am I? "
msgctxt "bark 0432:0703"
msgid "You are in the royal palace of the Lady Mordea. "
msgstr "你在莫爾迪亞夫人的王宮裡。"

# P13 batch 1
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Where am I? "
msgctxt "bark 0432:075E"
msgid "You had best be off before Mordea demands your head for trespassing. "
msgstr "你最好趁莫爾迪亞以擅闖的罪名要你的腦袋之前趕快離開。"

# P13 batch 1
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Bye "
msgctxt "bark 0432:07A9"
msgid "Very good. "
msgstr "很好。"

# P13 batch 1
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Bye "
msgctxt "bark 0432:0858"
msgid "I thank you for your assistance is deposing the tyrannical Mordea. Her unfair rulership has been brought to an end, thanks to you. "
msgstr "感謝你協助推翻暴虐的莫爾迪亞。多虧了你，她不公的統治終於結束了。"
